  "title": "extcap: ssh-base: Use ws_socketpair for multiplatform support",
  "description": "Since Windows can select() on AF_UNIX sockets, and libssh uses\nselect() for asynchronous communication, use ws_socketpair for\nthe ssh_select() loop. The control pipes are still not completely\nhooked up, so Windows does not actually get a signal that would\nquit yet. Ping #14239.",
